1. Kandinsky 6.0 Video Super-Resolution (kandinskylab)
   https://github.com/kandinskylab/kandinsky-video-sr
   MIT License (see LICENSE-MIT). Copyright (c) 2026 kandinskylab.

   The video side is reimplemented on ComfyUI's operations after the release's code, keeping the released parameter
   names so the converted weights load as they are:
   - kandinsky_sr/video/model.py: the SR transformer (core/components/model/dit.py, nn.py)
   - kandinsky_sr/video/nabla.py: the NABLA sparse attention masks (core/components/model/utils.py, nn.py)
   - kandinsky_sr/video/sampler.py: the degraded start latent and the pi-Flow sampler (core/algo/)
   - kandinsky_sr/video/pipeline.py: frame handling, tiling, stitching (pipeline/)
   - kandinsky_sr/video/kvae.py: the KVAE 3D 2.0 video VAE (core/components/video_kvae/)
   - kandinsky_sr/video/latent_upscaler.py: the latent upscalers (core/components/latent_upscaler/)
   - tools/convert_vsr_dit.py, tools/convert_kvae.py, tools/convert_latent_upscaler.py read the release's Diffusers
     bundle layout and configs.

2. Kandinsky ImageSR (kandinskylab)
   https://github.com/kandinskylab/kandinsky-image-sr
   MIT License (see LICENSE-MIT). Copyright (c) 2026 kandinskylab.

   - kandinsky_sr/image/model.py: the baked ImageSR transformer
   - kandinsky_sr/image/upscale.py: the tiled one-step pipeline
   - tools/convert_image_sr.py reads the release's Diffusers transformer.

3. ComfyUI-ReCaVSR (PedroMarinhoDev), GPL-3.0
   https://github.com/PedroMarinhoDev/ComfyUI-ReCaVSR
   - kandinsky_sr/video/video_io.py is adapted from recavsr/video_io.py (streamed video input and output).

The model weights are not part of this repository:

- Kandinsky 6.0 VSR 2.0, MIT: https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-6.0-VSR-2.0-distilled2steps-Diffusers
- Kandinsky ImageSR 2.0, MIT: https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-ImageSR-2.0
- the same as single ComfyUI files (bf16 and int8 ConvRot transformers, the KVAE, the latent upscalers):
  https://huggingface.co/PedroMarinhoDev/Kandinsky-SR-ComfyUI
- the FLUX.1 VAE the image nodes use, Apache-2.0: https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-schnell

